		(at 170.55 71.1)
		(descr "XKB5858-W-F (LCSC C2884737) used as momentary SPST-NO. Datasheet pins: (1)-(3) closed at rest, (2)+(5) and (4)+(6) internally common, (2)/(5)-(4)/(6) closed when pressed. Pad 1 = pins 2+5, pad 2 = pins 4+6, pins 1 and 3 (NC contact) are unnumbered mechanical pads. Fixes spring-2026 board where pins 1+3 and 2+4 were each merged into one pad, so the switch never connected pad 1 to pad 2.")
